Exact accumulation for OpenCPMD. Default off (-D__EXACT_ACC).
Against 062582b7cfd832d36f88f504cd08e4ead42eb404.

Stress components are exact sums, including the nonlocal strain term.
OpenMP plus-reductions in the stress loops are removed under the
switch and replaced by one accumulator per component.
The becs projection in nlsm1_s was a DGEMM over the local G count.
That partial, then MPI_SUM, left a rank-dependent off-diagonal denl.
exact_pairsum adds each G term and rounds once. The plane split is
unchanged.

